-- ============================================================================
-- v1400: Seed / sample data — Go-Live registers (v1399) for the demo project
-- ============================================================================
-- Owner request 2026-11-09: sample data where it was missing, 10 records for each Go-Live register,
-- for SEED334-PRJ-08 (fictional "Northbridge Bank" core banking replacement, the same scenario as the
-- Cutover, Operational Readiness, Testing and Data Migration samples).
-- Dated around today (9 Nov 2026): the production infrastructure build is complete, the go-live date and
-- Release 1 scope decisions are recorded, and configuration loads are under way. Opening balances carry
-- the latest mock baseline (Mock 2, 24 Oct 2026). Everything for the go-live weekend (9–12 April 2027)
-- and Day 1 (Monday 12 April) is planned.
-- Records: deployment 10, balances 10, day1 10, business 10, technical 10, decision 10.
-- Vendor-neutral (rule 26), person fields are plain text. display_id is left blank so Admin ID
-- Generation assigns it (rule 16.2). Fixed hex-only ids …-4000-b032- … b037- (ranges checked free
-- before use). ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING, and nothing is inserted if the project is missing.
-- Calculated values are worked out with the same rules as the app. The final query counts the
-- records per register, so a skipped insert is visible.
-- Prerequisites: v1399. Idempotent.
-- ============================================================================

